                    title:                  `Spark the Team`,
                    subtitle:               `You are a first-time innovation leader at a Manchester consumer-tech firm whose last three launches were safe refreshes. The board has bet the next 18 months on one breakthrough product for IFA Berlin — a date that will not move. Staff the pod, set the freedom-vs-focus dial, spend the front-end weeks, and pass the week-12 gate with a concept that is both novel and useful — without losing the people the bet depends on.`,
                    header_tag:             `12 Jan 2026 · Vanta Play Ltd, Manchester · 34 weeks to IFA Berlin · one breakthrough, one unproven pod`,
