                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (the commercial sponsor)`,
                    coach_intro:            `I pre-announced this to retailers, so the September date does not move. I will cancel the breakthrough brief at the week-12 gate unless you can show me a concept that is both new and useful, a team that is still firing, and a credible path to a prototype. Don't bring me forty dazzling sketches nobody can build, and don't bring me another safe refresh — and whatever you do, don't crush the very creativity I'm paying for.`,

